he note right?\n5. The table of what Mara can say. Does each row hold, in particular the 600 seconds added to each bound and the row for a key revoked as retired?\n\nThe head changes no Worker. No deployment follows it.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:c5dc0d952f38de417d02b31442748ba14f9b68ba","branch":"builder/token-after-revocation-20261101","conditions":"Independent exact-head review of 98d621c1…cc01fd3 with explicit Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions, filed with gs review naming git:sha1…f9b68ba first and resting on all 1 artifacts.","head":"98d621c1306a5ae02bad50b8e5dcef4abcc01fd3","no_git_artifact":"true","to":"4817b532e7a1a118634cb7947b05f7d5d16f726c9d30ea22ff7eaf7db3634e80"}}